      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is such a good idea. It incentivizes creators to keep adding value to existing bases, and lets users avoid feeling ripped off because a \"new version\" came out, and they don't wanna buy both. It makes no sense for someone to buy 1 version of an avi, when a later released bundle contains that same version.",
